# 名称：GitHub Copilot
# 来源：https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat/meta/geo/geosite/github-copilot.list
# 来源：https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SukkaW/Surge/master/Source/non_ip/ai.conf
# 来源：https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Rules/AIGC.list
# FORMAT: Surge RULE-SET
# 说明：GitHub Copilot dedicated endpoints; excludes generic api.github.com and telemetry. Microsoft Copilot is a different service.
# 证据：https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/reference/copilot-allowlist-reference

DOMAIN,copilot-proxy.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,copilot-workspace.githubnext.com
DOMAIN,copilotprodattachments.blob.core.windows.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubcopilot.com
